{"ref":"BDB, אָתוֹן","hw":"אָתוֹן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָתוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:23\" href=\"/Genesis.45.23\">Gn 45:23</a></sup> <strong>she-ass (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">أَتَانٌ</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">אַתָּנָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܰܬܳܢܳܐ</span>, Assyrian <em>atânu</em><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">אָתוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:23\" href=\"/Numbers.22.23\">Nu 22:23</a> + 10 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲתֹנְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:30\" href=\"/Numbers.22.30\">Nu 22:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:32\" href=\"/Numbers.22.32\">32</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲתֹנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:11\" href=\"/Genesis.49.11\">Gn 49:11</a> + 2 times; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲתֹנֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:16\" href=\"/Genesis.12.16\">Gn 12:16</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲתֹנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:10\" href=\"/Judges.5.10\">Ju 5:10</a> + 12 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲתוֹנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 1:3\" href=\"/Job.1.3\">Jb 1:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 42:12\" href=\"/Job.42.12\">42:12</a>;—<strong>she-ass</strong>, as dam <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:11\" href=\"/Genesis.49.11\">Gn 49:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:9\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.9\">Zc 9:9</a>; as property (constituting wealth) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:16\" href=\"/Genesis.12.16\">Gn 12:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:16\" href=\"/Genesis.32.16\">32:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 1:3\" href=\"/Job.1.3\">Jb 1:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 1:14\" href=\"/Job.1.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 42:12\" href=\"/Job.42.12\">42:12</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.30\">1 Ch 27:30</a>; so of the asses of Kish 8 times <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.3\">1 S 9:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.2\">10:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.16\">16</a>; as beasts of burden <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:23\" href=\"/Genesis.45.23\">Gn 45:23</a>; for riding <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:10\" href=\"/Judges.5.10\">Ju 5:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:21\" href=\"/Numbers.22.21\">Nu 22:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:22\" href=\"/Numbers.22.22\">22</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.22\">2 K 4:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:24\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.24\">24</a>; of Balaam’s ass 14 times <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:21\" href=\"/Numbers.22.21\">Nu 22:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:22\" href=\"/Numbers.22.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:23\" href=\"/Numbers.22.23\">23</a><sup>(×3)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:25\" href=\"/Numbers.22.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:27\" href=\"/Numbers.22.27\">27</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:28\" href=\"/Numbers.22.28\">28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:29\" href=\"/Numbers.22.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:30\" href=\"/Numbers.22.30\">30</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:32\" href=\"/Numbers.22.32\">32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:33\" href=\"/Numbers.22.33\">33</a>.","next":"BDB, אֵתָן","prev":"BDB, אתן"}